bout expressing views rather than fighting over power.\n\nAlternatively, perhaps the answer is D because it's a trade interaction, not a conflict over power.\n\nWait, perhaps the correct answer is C because it's about expressing views, not fighting. So I think the answer is C.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is C) Two councillors publicly preaching their political views on the street. This is not political struggle because it involves expressing views rather than fighting over power. \n\nAnswer: C",
