e new rate, but it's more about the reasoning than the starting point.\n\nOption C states that the 25% rate is moderately low internationally. The passage does mention that the new rate is low, which is good for the international community, but it's not the main content of the passage. The main content is about the new tax rate and its implications, not just stating the rate.\n\nOption D says adjusting the tax rate will help improve competitiveness. The passage does discuss how the new rate helps improve competitiveness and attract foreign investment, which aligns with option D.\n\nSo, the main content is about how adjusting the tax rate helps improve competitiveness, which is option D.\n</think>\n\nThe main content of the passage is about how adjusting the tax rate helps improve the competitiveness of enterprises. \n\n**Answer: D**",
