ied again.\n\nSo, the most important point is that the person kept trying after missing the first opportunity, which is about not being discouraged and continuing to pursue. That's best captured by option B.\n</think>\n\nThe story illustrates the importance of persistence and not being discouraged when faced with failure. The person tried again after missing the first opportunity, showing that it's okay to keep trying. This aligns with the idea of not losing oneself and continuing to pursue, which is option B.\n\n**Answer: B**",
